<article class="env-exercise" id="0DD5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DD5">Exercise <span data-tag="0DD5">111.48.5</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a ringed space. Let $\mathcal{E}$ be a finite locally free $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module. Construct a trace map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^ i_ X(\mathcal{E}, \mathcal{E}) \to H^ i(X, \mathcal{O}_ X)  \]
</div>
  <p> for all $i$. Generalize to a trace map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathop{\mathrm{Ext}}\nolimits ^ i_ X(\mathcal{E}, \mathcal{E} \otimes _{\mathcal{O}_ X} \mathcal{F}) \to H^ i(X, \mathcal{F})  \]
</div>
  <p> for any $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module $\mathcal{F}$. </p>
</article>